---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service"
  path="/terms"
  description="Terms of Service governing hosted services, CLIs, and software libraries operated by Northlatch Labs LLC."
>
  <section class="page-hero" style="padding-bottom:28px">
    <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
      <p class="cmd">Governance</p>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="lede">Commercial terms governing services, CLIs, and software operated by Northlatch Labs LLC.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="border-top:0;padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
      <div class="doc-card">
        <div class="doc-section">
          <h2>Scope</h2>
          <p>These terms apply to every hosted service, command-line tool, and library published by Northlatch Labs LLC under <code>northlatch.tech</code> and <code>projectxprotocol.dev</code>. Using our software constitutes acceptance of these terms.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-section">
          <h2>Account Responsibility</h2>
          <p>Keep your credentials and signing keys private. Any action authenticated with your keys is treated as authorized by you. Report suspicious activity immediately to <a href="mailto:security@projectxprotocol.dev" class="accent">security@projectxprotocol.dev</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-section">
          <h2>Billing &amp; Refunds</h2>
          <p>Paid software tiers are billed monthly in advance. You may cancel at any time, and refunds are available within seven days of the initial charge on a plan.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-section">
          <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>Software is provided as-is. Do not use any software to manage or transfer funds you cannot afford to lose without conducting your own independent security review.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-section">
          <h2>Termination &amp; Governing Law</h2>
          <p>We may suspend accounts for abuse, unpaid balances, or unlawful use, and you may delete your account at any time. These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Delaware, USA, with disputes resolved in the courts of New Castle County.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-meta">Last updated 2026-09-21 &middot; Northlatch Labs LLC</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
